# Jett's noncombat tap ability causes her first mode's surveil trigger while she has less than four power (CR 701.25, 603.2).
# Jett Reno, Problem Solver {1}{U}: Legendary Creature — Human Artificer
#   Whenever Jett Reno becomes tapped, surveil 1. If her power is 4 or greater, instead draw a card.
#   Whenever you face a dilemma, put a +1/1 counter on Jett Reno. (You face a dilemma as you choose one or more modes for a spell or ability.)
# Springleaf Drum taps Jett to pay its ability's cost; the surveil puts the top card into the graveyard, and nothing is drawn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Jett Reno, Problem Solver
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Island
Springleaf Drum
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Jett Reno, Problem Solver.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Springleaf Drum.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Springleaf Drum.Activate(Tap: Jett Reno, Problem Solver; Color: Blue)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Arrange( | Island)

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Island
Bot1.Library.Count = 17
Bot1.Battlefield.Jett Reno, Problem Solver.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Jett Reno, Problem Solver.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
